description:
Design a configurable NOT gate that operates on a specified width (default of 8 bits). The module inverts each bit of the input vector, producing an output vector where each bit is the logical negation of the corresponding input bit. This is achieved using a generate block to instantiate multiple NOT operations in parallel based on the parameter WIDTH.
module top_module(
  input [WIDTH-1:0] in,
  output [WIDTH-1:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
  input [WIDTH-1:0] in,
  output [WIDTH-1:0] out
);parameter WIDTH = 8;

  genvar i;

  generate
    for (i = 0; i < WIDTH; i = i + 1) begin : NOT_GATE
      assign out[i] = ~in[i];
    end
  endgenerate

endmodule

